WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Facility365 explained in one minute.

00:04.000 --> 00:14.000
Dashboard and Today show what needs doing right away.

00:14.000 --> 00:19.000
Report damage: describe it, pick the location – done.

00:19.000 --> 00:23.000
The damage becomes an order with one tap.

00:23.000 --> 00:28.000
The order shows the site, asset and person responsible.

00:28.000 --> 00:31.000
The report records work, materials and time – as a PDF.

00:31.000 --> 00:37.000
Maintenance and inspections run on intervals – including emergency equipment.

00:37.000 --> 00:40.000
Cleaning: check off tasks per room.

00:40.000 --> 00:50.000
Suppliers, invoices and outdoor areas with winter service and plant recognition.

00:50.000 --> 00:57.000
Every asset has a QR code – scanning opens the record. Facility365, that simple.

